Select corresponding file.
.TP
.B 1-9
Select page 1-9.
.TP
.B 0
Select page 10.
.TP
.B +
Select next page.
.TP
.B ;
Same as
.B +.
.TP
.B \-
Select previous page.
.TP
.B ^\ (Home)
Change to home directory.
.TP
.B /
Change to root directory.
.TP
.B ?
